self.KB_CONTENT["card:755526"]={"id":"card:755526","ty":"card","sourceId":"755526","title":"『實盤資料補入作業』中的『盤點數量 (TC008)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"盤點","keywords":["盤點","實際"],"y":"other","answer":"* 實際盤點數量，僅作顯示。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:755768"]={"id":"card:755768","ty":"card","sourceId":"755768","title":"『品號變更明細表』中的『列印單價金額』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"明細表","keywords":["明細表","品號","權限","單價"],"y":"other","answer":"* 預設Y。* 若無售價權限者，預設N且不可修改。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:756798"]={"id":"card:756798","ty":"card","sourceId":"756798","title":"『遞延收入維護作業』的作業重點有哪些？","ver":"iGP","topic":"單身","keywords":["單身","傳票","單頭","每月"],"y":"explain","answer":"1.單身每月迴轉金額之合計須與單頭遞延收入相等。2.若遞延收入已產生遞延傳票或迴轉傳票，則此筆資料不可刪除。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
